// RUN: cd %corpus && ! %zomc compile --check 08-adt/inherent_method_mutating_field_read_neg_04.zom > %t 2>&1
// RUN: %FileCheck %s --input-file %t

// Reading a field through the implicit `this` receiver is admitted only for
// shared receivers in this slice. The same `this.value` read inside a
// `mutating` method is well-formed source the HIR/MIR/LIR rail cannot lower
// yet, so the body checker reports the capability rejection ZOM4125 on the
// field access, never an internal compiler error.

// CHECK-LITERAL: Error [ZOM4125]: method call `get` is not supported yet
// CHECK-LITERAL:   --> conformance/08-adt/inherent_method_mutating_field_read_neg_04.zom:3:42
